WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.792 --> 00:00:17.583
[♪ legendary music playing]

2
00:00:17.667 --> 00:00:19.208
[lightsaber activates]

3
00:00:22.167 --> 00:00:23.167
[♪ music fades]

4
00:00:26.458 --> 00:00:28.458
[♪ theme music playing]

5
00:00:45.458 --> 00:00:47.208
[beeping]

6
00:00:52.625 --> 00:00:53.833
[Gramps] Huh?

7
00:00:53.917 --> 00:00:56.125
There's no need to worry. okay?

8
00:00:56.208 --> 00:01:00.333
We're heading straight for Bibin.
just as the Margrave directed.

9
00:01:00.417 --> 00:01:03.792
I'm not worried with all the experience
you have. old-timer.

10
00:01:03.875 --> 00:01:07.500
[Gramps] Oh? [laughs]

11
00:01:07.583 --> 00:01:09.583
-[whirring]
-[lightsaber buzzing]

12
00:01:09.667 --> 00:01:10.917
[Kara breathes deeply]

13
00:01:13.417 --> 00:01:14.417
[grunts]

14
00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:17.125
-[lasers firing]
-[grunting]

15
00:01:21.083 --> 00:01:22.792
-[grunting]
-[clangs]

16
00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:24.750
[Juro] That's enough.

17
00:01:25.208 --> 00:01:26.417
[panting]

18
00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:28.375
Your mind is elsewhere right now.

19
00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:31.583
Focus and be in the moment.

20
00:01:32.458 --> 00:01:33.500
[Juro sighs]

21
00:01:33.583 --> 00:01:36.417
Something is troubling you.
Tell me what it is.

22
00:01:38.167 --> 00:01:40.167
[Kara] When we were on Makoma Ko.

23
00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:42.000
the man we met...

24
00:01:42.083 --> 00:01:43.458
The one named Gennoh...

25
00:01:43.542 --> 00:01:45.417
he had a red lightsaber.

26
00:01:46.417 --> 00:01:49.417
I was just wondering
if it is possible that my father. he...

27
00:01:50.083 --> 00:01:51.875
made that red lightsaber.

28
00:01:53.208 --> 00:01:56.500
Hmm. There is an old Jedi tale...

29
00:01:56.583 --> 00:01:58.208
-Huh?
-[Juro] Of course.

30
00:01:58.292 --> 00:01:59.958
you wouldn't have heard it.

31
00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:07.958
A long time ago. our former Master
once tried to revive the Jedi Order

32
00:02:08.042 --> 00:02:10.917
to bring about peace in the galaxy.

33
00:02:11.958 --> 00:02:15.542
<i>Just as darkness</i>
<i>is born wherever there is light.</i>

34
00:02:15.625 --> 00:02:20.958
<i>so emerged those who used the Force</i>
<i>to bring about selfishness and greed.</i>

35
00:02:21.042 --> 00:02:22.875
<i>They were called the Sith.</i>

36
00:02:23.708 --> 00:02:25.583
That lightsaber he wielded

37
00:02:25.667 --> 00:02:28.208
could have been one
handed down from long ago.

38
00:02:28.292 --> 00:02:30.833
So. then my father might not have made it.

39
00:02:30.917 --> 00:02:32.417
[chuckles]

40
00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:35.833
The one thing I know about Zhima
is that he's the type of man

41
00:02:35.917 --> 00:02:39.292
who would not aid a Sith.
even if his life depended on it.

42
00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:41.750
[sighs]

43
00:02:43.208 --> 00:02:46.750
I believe you.
but something still seems off. Juro.

44
00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:49.750
I have a bad feeling about this.

45
00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:54.708
Juro. I need to see my father.

46
00:02:54.792 --> 00:02:57.167
We have to find him as soon as possible.

47
00:02:58.333 --> 00:03:00.917
Trust me. I understand how you feel.

48
00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:05.583
Nevertheless. facing Nawaam alone
would not be a smart decision.

49
00:03:05.667 --> 00:03:07.458
We need more Jedi.

50
00:03:07.542 --> 00:03:10.625
We need soldiers
who will be willing to fight alongside us.

51
00:03:11.542 --> 00:03:12.542
[sighs]

52
00:03:14.875 --> 00:03:16.708
[Juro chuckles]

53
00:03:16.792 --> 00:03:18.042
[gasps]

54
00:03:18.667 --> 00:03:21.500
Kara. you have a strong connection
to the Force.

55
00:03:21.583 --> 00:03:24.958
Trust in the Force.
and listen to your heart.

56
00:03:25.042 --> 00:03:27.750
And when the time is right. we will know.

57
00:03:28.375 --> 00:03:29.375
[Kara] Hmm.

58
00:03:30.167 --> 00:03:31.167
[digital beeping]

59
00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:32.417
-[Kara gasps]
-[Juro] Hmm?

60
00:03:33.333 --> 00:03:35.333
[Homen over comms] <i>Juro.</i>
<i>please come to the bridge.</i>

61
00:03:35.417 --> 00:03:37.208
<i>We'll be exiting hyperspace shortly.</i>

62
00:03:38.125 --> 00:03:39.667
{\an8}[♪ captivating music playing]

63
00:03:42.708 --> 00:03:44.542
Whoa. [gasps]

64
00:03:50.042 --> 00:03:52.750
[gasps] It's huge...

65
00:03:59.958 --> 00:04:01.417
[Homen] There it is.

66
00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:04.250
I've always dreamed
of stepping foot on Bibin.

67
00:04:04.333 --> 00:04:05.542
-How come?
-[Homen] Hmm?

68
00:04:07.208 --> 00:04:12.833
[sighs] Let's just say. this place.
it's special to us.

69
00:04:12.917 --> 00:04:14.792
-A long time ago...
-[Kara gasps]

70
00:04:14.875 --> 00:04:16.667
...there was a Jedi who. on his own.

71
00:04:17.375 --> 00:04:19.750
founded a small order there.

72
00:04:19.833 --> 00:04:24.000
And it was there on Bibin
where I studied the Force.

73
00:04:24.083 --> 00:04:25.625
As did your father.

74
00:04:25.708 --> 00:04:27.875
It was where he became a Jedi.

75
00:04:27.958 --> 00:04:29.500
[Kara gasps]

76
00:04:29.583 --> 00:04:31.583
[♪ dramatic music playing]

77
00:04:36.208 --> 00:04:39.083
[surveillance droid beeping and chirping]

78
00:04:41.792 --> 00:04:43.083
[ships whooshing]

79
00:04:43.167 --> 00:04:44.625
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

80
00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:56.500
[Four-Nines chirps]

81
00:04:58.083 --> 00:05:00.333
[whirring. clicking]

82
00:05:00.417 --> 00:05:01.875
[Four-Nines whirring]

83
00:05:01.958 --> 00:05:03.333
[quietly] Hurry it up. will ya?

84
00:05:03.417 --> 00:05:05.208
[Four-Nines speaking Droid]

85
00:05:05.292 --> 00:05:06.292
[in English] Wait. what?

86
00:05:06.375 --> 00:05:09.708
You think I was spooked
by seeing Nawaam's lightsaber?

87
00:05:10.292 --> 00:05:12.792
[chuckles] No way. Not in the least.

88
00:05:12.875 --> 00:05:14.000
[gasps]

89
00:05:21.458 --> 00:05:22.958
Kyber crystals?

90
00:05:23.042 --> 00:05:24.833
[Four-Nines speaking Droid]

91
00:05:25.583 --> 00:05:28.083
[in English] What do you think
they're doing with so many of them?

92
00:05:28.167 --> 00:05:29.792
What could they be planning? [grunts]

93
00:05:29.875 --> 00:05:31.792
[Four-Nines speaking Droid]

94
00:05:31.875 --> 00:05:33.125
[steam hissing]

95
00:05:35.292 --> 00:05:36.708
[ship powering up]

96
00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:44.542
[machinery whirring]

97
00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:59.083
[♪ suspenseful music continues]

98
00:06:00.792 --> 00:06:03.375
-[Ethan grunts]
-[Four-Nines whirring]

99
00:06:04.292 --> 00:06:06.417
[mechanical whirring]

100
00:06:15.083 --> 00:06:17.583
[Gennoh] I beg your forgiveness.
General Nawaam.

101
00:06:17.667 --> 00:06:19.917
I failed to capture Juro.

102
00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.000
I am prepared to accept your punishment.

103
00:06:22.917 --> 00:06:26.958
[Nawaam] I have no intention
to punish the last of the Sith.

104
00:06:27.042 --> 00:06:32.750
You will have your opportunity
to face Juro again and stop him next time.

105
00:06:32.833 --> 00:06:35.542
[Gennoh] I'm sorry. but... it wasn't him.

106
00:06:35.625 --> 00:06:38.042
It was Lah Zhima's daughter
who got in my way.

107
00:06:38.125 --> 00:06:39.167
[Nawaam] Oh?

108
00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:41.875
[Gennoh] I sensed that the Force
is strong with her.

109
00:06:41.958 --> 00:06:43.917
The sooner we defeat her. the better.

110
00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:49.000
[mechanical whirring]

111
00:06:49.083 --> 00:06:52.083
[Gennoh] Who could have thought
they could be used this way?

112
00:06:57.000 --> 00:07:01.167
[Nawaam] I can think of no better way
than to use this symbol

113
00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:03.500
to show the galaxy our power.

114
00:07:04.208 --> 00:07:06.458
[Four-Nines speaking Droid]

115
00:07:07.375 --> 00:07:10.667
[In English] They're using the crystals
to make a weapon?

116
00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:13.375
[weapon powering up]

117
00:07:13.458 --> 00:07:15.000
[electronic beeping]

118
00:07:15.083 --> 00:07:17.083
[♪ sinister music playing]

119
00:07:20.125 --> 00:07:22.000
[beeping continues]

120
00:07:22.083 --> 00:07:23.083
[Ethan gasps]

121
00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.583
[weapon powering up]

122
00:07:27.667 --> 00:07:29.625
-[alarm beeping]
-[Nawaam] Huh?

123
00:07:29.708 --> 00:07:31.333
-[electricity crackling]
-[all gasping]

124
00:07:31.417 --> 00:07:34.375
[scientists screaming]

125
00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:38.583
[weapon powering down]

126
00:07:38.667 --> 00:07:39.958
[scientists groaning]

127
00:07:40.042 --> 00:07:41.500
I'm sorry. General Nawaam.

128
00:07:41.583 --> 00:07:43.792
but we're still unable to get the crystals
to resonate with the--

129
00:07:43.875 --> 00:07:44.875
-[electricity crackling]
-[wincing]

130
00:07:46.458 --> 00:07:48.583
-[Nawaam] Bring me Lord Zhima.
-[droid beeps]

131
00:07:52.167 --> 00:07:53.500
[breathes heavily]

132
00:07:59.542 --> 00:08:01.500
<i>Well. this is certainly a surprise.</i>

133
00:08:01.583 --> 00:08:06.083
<i>I never expected any Jedi to come</i>
<i>back to this planet. Margrave Juro.</i>

134
00:08:06.167 --> 00:08:08.750
Thank you for granting me an audience.
Lady Tafflah.

135
00:08:09.458 --> 00:08:10.917
We are most grateful that you---

136
00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:12.792
<i>Spare me the pleasantries.</i>

137
00:08:12.875 --> 00:08:16.958
<i>I'm quite busy at the moment.</i>
<i>so please just state your business.</i>

138
00:08:17.458 --> 00:08:18.917
<i>What is it that brings you here?</i>

139
00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:20.375
Uh...

140
00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:25.083
There is a general named Nawaam
who seeks to gain control of the galaxy

141
00:08:25.167 --> 00:08:27.833
and whose influence is rapidly expanding.

142
00:08:27.917 --> 00:08:30.833
I am of the opinion
that this will lead us all to destruction.

143
00:08:31.375 --> 00:08:34.167
As a Jedi. I cannot sit by and do nothing.

144
00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:35.583
[Tafflah sighs]

145
00:08:38.958 --> 00:08:40.750
And so I was guided here.

146
00:08:41.917 --> 00:08:45.208
<i>You were guided here?</i>
<i>You mean guided by the Force?</i>

147
00:08:46.333 --> 00:08:49.542
<i>I'm sorry to say this.</i>
<i>but from my perspective.</i>

148
00:08:49.625 --> 00:08:51.208
<i>-you Jedi seem to be nothing more...</i>
-[gasps]

149
00:08:51.292 --> 00:08:53.167
<i>...than bringers of chaos.</i>

150
00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:55.208
<i>Surely you couldn't have already forgotten</i>

151
00:08:55.292 --> 00:08:57.375
<i>about that incident.</i>
<i>have you. Margrave Juro?</i>

152
00:08:57.458 --> 00:08:59.083
[Kara sighs]

153
00:08:59.875 --> 00:09:01.042
[sighs]

154
00:09:01.667 --> 00:09:03.917
I can't stress how dangerous Nawaam is.

155
00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:05.000
He must be stopped.

156
00:09:05.083 --> 00:09:07.167
[sighs wearily]

157
00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:08.542
<i>Very well. then.</i>

158
00:09:08.625 --> 00:09:13.250
<i>At any rate. I have no desire to further</i>
<i>dwell on the tragedies of the past.</i>

159
00:09:13.333 --> 00:09:15.083
<i>But as you already know.</i>

160
00:09:15.167 --> 00:09:18.083
<i>there are no longer</i>
<i>any Jedi left on our planet.</i>

161
00:09:18.167 --> 00:09:20.250
What we are searching for are allies

162
00:09:20.333 --> 00:09:23.042
who will stand up with us
for the sake of the galaxy.

163
00:09:25.625 --> 00:09:27.458
<i>You are free to conduct your search.</i>

164
00:09:27.542 --> 00:09:29.500
<i>However. keep in mind that our planet</i>

165
00:09:29.583 --> 00:09:32.375
<i>recognizes the sovereignty</i>
<i>of each and every person.</i>

166
00:09:37.208 --> 00:09:39.042
We will land in the mining region.

167
00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:40.750
[Gramps] Alrighty.

168
00:09:42.333 --> 00:09:43.333
[whooshes]

169
00:09:46.958 --> 00:09:51.000
[quietly] Hey. Homen. do you know why
the Jedi Order on this planet dissolved?

170
00:09:51.083 --> 00:09:52.417
And what incident?

171
00:09:53.833 --> 00:09:58.917
[Homen] The story is that the Master who
oversaw the Jedi Order here was killed...

172
00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:01.125
by his own Padawan.

173
00:10:02.833 --> 00:10:04.625
[engine whirring]

174
00:10:10.167 --> 00:10:11.792
[digital beeping]

175
00:10:11.875 --> 00:10:13.917
What's this? There's an asteroid

176
00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:17.000
-that's headed straight for us.
-No. don't worry. We'll be fine.

177
00:10:17.083 --> 00:10:18.083
But...

178
00:10:18.458 --> 00:10:19.583
[Homen and Kara gasp]

179
00:10:20.417 --> 00:10:21.542
[gasps]

180
00:10:21.625 --> 00:10:23.750
[Juro] I can handle it from here.

181
00:10:29.917 --> 00:10:31.917
[♪ mysterious music playing]

182
00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:36.000
[doors whirring]

183
00:10:36.083 --> 00:10:38.833
[gasps] Are you sure that this is safe?

184
00:10:38.917 --> 00:10:41.708
Trust me. Just follow them in.

185
00:10:59.375 --> 00:11:01.750
[Kara grunts] Hmm.

186
00:11:06.542 --> 00:11:07.875
[whooshing]

187
00:11:08.917 --> 00:11:10.083
[thuds]

188
00:11:10.167 --> 00:11:11.667
[ship hisses]

189
00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:14.667
[Kara] Are these the soldiers
we were looking for?

190
00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:16.958
But they're just regular miners. right?

191
00:11:17.042 --> 00:11:18.625
It would seem so. wouldn't it?

192
00:11:19.917 --> 00:11:20.917
Huh?

193
00:11:21.667 --> 00:11:23.792
[♪ tense music playing]

194
00:11:23.875 --> 00:11:24.917
[Kara pants]

195
00:11:29.417 --> 00:11:30.417
[♪ music ends]

196
00:11:34.542 --> 00:11:35.708
[blade slashes]

197
00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:40.125
-[blade clangs]
-[Kara and Homen gasp]

198
00:11:41.333 --> 00:11:42.333
Draw now!

199
00:11:44.167 --> 00:11:46.042
[gasps] Juro!

200
00:11:46.875 --> 00:11:48.917
-[Juro grunts]
-[man grunts]

201
00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:51.000
-[blades clanging]
-[both grunting]

202
00:11:55.708 --> 00:11:57.667
-[Kara gasps]
-[Juro grunts]

203
00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:00.875
[both grunting]

204
00:12:00.958 --> 00:12:02.250
[blades clang]

205
00:12:05.667 --> 00:12:09.250
-[blades clang]
-[whimpers. shudders]

206
00:12:09.333 --> 00:12:10.542
-[man laughs]
-[gasps]

207
00:12:10.625 --> 00:12:12.750
[continues laughing]

208
00:12:12.833 --> 00:12:16.000
Now that's true Jedi mastery
if I've ever seen it.

209
00:12:16.083 --> 00:12:17.917
Not too shabby yourself.

210
00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:20.750
It's nice to see
you haven't gotten rusty. Kwana.

211
00:12:20.833 --> 00:12:24.208
It's been far too long.
You look like you're in good health.

212
00:12:25.375 --> 00:12:29.375
Hey! Everyone. Master Juro
has returned to Bibin!

213
00:12:29.458 --> 00:12:30.458
[miner] Mmm-mmm.

214
00:12:32.208 --> 00:12:33.833
-[Kara gasps]
-[Gramps] Huh?

215
00:12:36.250 --> 00:12:37.917
Sorry about them.

216
00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:40.417
They don't bear you
any ill will or anything.

217
00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:43.083
No worries. It's a natural reaction.

218
00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:48.292
Ever since that incident.
people view the Jedi differently.

219
00:12:48.375 --> 00:12:50.625
It must have been hard for you.

220
00:12:50.708 --> 00:12:54.250
You looked up to Master Reno
more than anyone else I knew.

221
00:12:54.958 --> 00:12:58.708
[Kwana] Oh. my dream of becoming a Jedi
is a thing of the past.

222
00:13:00.042 --> 00:13:01.750
Uh. but speaking of...

223
00:13:01.833 --> 00:13:04.667
would you mind giving me
a peek of your lightsaber. Juro?

224
00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:06.125
[grunts]

225
00:13:06.792 --> 00:13:08.875
I know I probably shouldn't be asking.

226
00:13:08.958 --> 00:13:13.667
but I'm just so proud that my old friend
is now a true Jedi Master.

227
00:13:18.292 --> 00:13:20.625
[lightsaber buzzing]

228
00:13:20.708 --> 00:13:22.417
[gasps]

229
00:13:25.333 --> 00:13:26.667
[Kwana sighs]

230
00:13:28.708 --> 00:13:31.333
[Kara grunts] Hmm?

231
00:13:33.167 --> 00:13:35.458
So. the two of you know each other?

232
00:13:35.542 --> 00:13:37.708
It's a little more than just that.

233
00:13:37.792 --> 00:13:40.708
The two of us.
we spent our youth together.

234
00:13:40.792 --> 00:13:43.125
-We're like brothers.
-[Juro] Hmm.

235
00:13:44.958 --> 00:13:46.500
Kwana. my friend.

236
00:13:46.583 --> 00:13:48.250
I have a favor to ask of you.

237
00:13:48.333 --> 00:13:51.083
It is something that involves
not only you. but the miners.

238
00:13:51.167 --> 00:13:53.875
I can't imagine
what a Jedi would need help with.

239
00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:56.500
I need help stopping a war.

240
00:13:57.250 --> 00:13:58.958
And I seek your aid.

241
00:14:00.333 --> 00:14:02.208
You're speaking of Nawaam.

242
00:14:02.292 --> 00:14:05.167
I've heard tales of his fearsomeness.

243
00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:06.667
[Juro grunts]

244
00:14:06.750 --> 00:14:08.750
[♪ tense music playing]

245
00:14:22.292 --> 00:14:24.500
[Nawaam] What are these for?

246
00:14:24.583 --> 00:14:27.792
[droid] Well. he may not be armed.
but as a prisoner--

247
00:14:27.875 --> 00:14:29.375
[rumbling]

248
00:14:31.917 --> 00:14:34.292
-[Four-Nines speaking Droid]
-[Ethan gasps]

249
00:14:37.125 --> 00:14:41.000
[Nawaam in English] My apologies
for the disrespect. master.

250
00:14:41.083 --> 00:14:45.667
I've told you many times.
I am not your Master. Nawaam.

251
00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:47.458
[Nawaam exhales]

252
00:14:48.167 --> 00:14:49.167
[Ethan] <i>Master?</i>

253
00:14:49.750 --> 00:14:52.125
[electronic beeping]

254
00:14:52.208 --> 00:14:55.083
[low whirring]

255
00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:57.917
Those are kyber crystals.

256
00:14:58.000 --> 00:14:59.542
[weapon powering up]

257
00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:02.958
[electricity crackling]

258
00:15:03.042 --> 00:15:05.042
-[scientists grunting]
-[weapon whirring]

259
00:15:05.833 --> 00:15:07.875
[electricity crackling]

260
00:15:09.625 --> 00:15:11.708
[weapon powering down]

261
00:15:20.708 --> 00:15:22.292
[whirring]

262
00:15:25.542 --> 00:15:26.542
Hmm.

263
00:15:26.625 --> 00:15:28.625
[♪ mysterious music playing]

264
00:15:33.292 --> 00:15:34.667
[whooshes]

265
00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:36.583
[kyber crystals crackling]

266
00:15:40.208 --> 00:15:42.000
-[dings]
-[whooshes]

267
00:15:43.042 --> 00:15:45.417
[electronic beeping]

268
00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:47.750
It's suddenly restabilized.

269
00:15:47.833 --> 00:15:51.125
I don't understand how this happened.
[grunts]

270
00:15:53.958 --> 00:15:57.083
[Nawaam] I expected nothing less. Master.

271
00:15:58.667 --> 00:16:01.958
What you've done
goes against the laws of nature.

272
00:16:02.042 --> 00:16:05.500
If you keep this up.
you will destroy the entire planet.

273
00:16:07.417 --> 00:16:10.667
[Nawaam] That is a device
that will bring about people's awakening.

274
00:16:10.750 --> 00:16:15.583
Once the crystal's light is unleashed.
they will come to realize the truth.

275
00:16:15.667 --> 00:16:19.417
That there is only one thing
needed for peace... and that is strength.

276
00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:23.542
I knew that once I explained.
you would understand. Master.

277
00:16:24.625 --> 00:16:25.625
[grunts]

278
00:16:27.208 --> 00:16:29.542
[droid] Lord Nawaam.
our surveillance satellites

279
00:16:29.625 --> 00:16:31.208
have located the exact location

280
00:16:31.292 --> 00:16:33.167
-of Juro's ship.
-[gasps] Hmm.

281
00:16:34.625 --> 00:16:37.250
[whirring. beeping]

282
00:16:39.542 --> 00:16:41.917
[ships whooshing]

283
00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:45.375
[all laughing]

284
00:16:47.917 --> 00:16:49.917
[♪ lively music playing]

285
00:16:51.500 --> 00:16:55.125
From the looks of things.
this Kwana is quite popular.

286
00:16:55.208 --> 00:16:56.208
Yeah.

287
00:16:57.625 --> 00:16:59.417
-Kara. come with me.
-[Kara] Huh?

288
00:16:59.500 --> 00:17:01.750
-Homen. you should hear this as well.
-[Homen] Hmm?

289
00:17:01.833 --> 00:17:03.667
[lively chatter]

290
00:17:06.875 --> 00:17:10.042
Oh. Juro! Look.

291
00:17:10.125 --> 00:17:12.792
See how many fearless folk have gathered!

292
00:17:12.875 --> 00:17:15.167
Now. tell me how we can help you.

293
00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:22.542
[Juro exhales]

294
00:17:24.792 --> 00:17:27.000
[Juro] Zhima was abducted by Nawaam.

295
00:17:27.083 --> 00:17:28.708
What? Is that really true?

296
00:17:29.333 --> 00:17:31.375
I kept him in hiding on Hy Izlan

297
00:17:31.458 --> 00:17:34.917
where he created a new life for himself
as a sabersmith.

298
00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:36.958
I'm not sure how exactly.

299
00:17:37.042 --> 00:17:40.583
but Nawaam must have caught wind of it
and then abducted him.

300
00:17:40.667 --> 00:17:45.375
No doubt Nawaam wants to use Zhima's
technology in his galactic conquest.

301
00:17:45.458 --> 00:17:47.708
And that is why I must rescue him.

302
00:17:48.167 --> 00:17:51.833
Hmm. I still remember that day.

303
00:17:51.917 --> 00:17:54.208
We were so young. you. me. and him.

304
00:17:54.292 --> 00:17:58.542
We all swore to each other that we would
eventually become Jedi one day.

305
00:17:58.625 --> 00:18:00.708
Back then we called him brother.

306
00:18:02.125 --> 00:18:04.417
And today. he's a wanton criminal.

307
00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:05.625
[both gasp]

308
00:18:05.708 --> 00:18:07.417
Huh?

309
00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:10.167
This girl is Zhima's daughter.

310
00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:13.083
She traveled all this way
to save her father.

311
00:18:13.167 --> 00:18:16.042
Huh? [gasps. stutters]

312
00:18:16.125 --> 00:18:18.125
I don't believe it.

313
00:18:18.208 --> 00:18:20.083
-[Kara] Juro...
-[Kwana] Hmm?

314
00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:23.167
Sorry. but... what was he talking about?

315
00:18:23.792 --> 00:18:24.792
-[Juro] Kara.
-[gasps]

316
00:18:24.875 --> 00:18:26.583
The sad truth is.

317
00:18:26.667 --> 00:18:30.250
your father was exiled from Bibin
as a criminal.

318
00:18:30.333 --> 00:18:33.833
His crime was murdering his master.
Reno Tsutara.

319
00:18:33.917 --> 00:18:35.208
[Kara gasps]

320
00:18:37.042 --> 00:18:38.625
There has to be more to it!

321
00:18:41.917 --> 00:18:44.875
I'm afraid I don't know
the details of what happened.

322
00:18:44.958 --> 00:18:47.333
since I was already
on Hy Izlan at that time.

323
00:18:47.417 --> 00:18:49.542
<i>so I only heard the rumors.</i>

324
00:18:50.333 --> 00:18:53.750
<i>Then one day.</i>
<i>he suddenly appeared before me.</i>

325
00:18:53.833 --> 00:18:55.625
<i>He looked to be in a pitiful state.</i>

326
00:18:55.708 --> 00:18:59.208
<i>He requested that I shelter him</i>
<i>and asked me not to ask any questions.</i>

327
00:18:59.292 --> 00:19:00.333
[Baby Kara crying]

328
00:19:00.417 --> 00:19:03.208
[Juro] <i>In his arms was you as a baby.</i>

329
00:19:03.292 --> 00:19:05.292
-[crying]
-[♪ somber music playing]

330
00:19:06.833 --> 00:19:08.708
[breath trembling]

331
00:19:09.333 --> 00:19:13.000
But Juro. how can you help him
after what he's done?

332
00:19:14.792 --> 00:19:19.042
Our master was killed... by his hand.

333
00:19:24.542 --> 00:19:26.792
I still believe in Zhima.

334
00:19:26.875 --> 00:19:28.750
He must've had his reasons.

335
00:19:30.792 --> 00:19:34.542
And I came here hoping
that you would feel the same way. brother.

336
00:19:37.583 --> 00:19:39.208
[indistinct chatter]

337
00:19:39.292 --> 00:19:41.333
[all laughing]

338
00:19:41.417 --> 00:19:43.167
-[laughing stops]
-[miner] Hmm?

339
00:19:43.833 --> 00:19:44.875
[miners exclaim]

340
00:19:44.958 --> 00:19:46.333
[miners murmuring]

341
00:19:52.083 --> 00:19:54.000
Thank you all for coming today.

342
00:19:54.083 --> 00:19:55.708
My name is Margrave Juro.

343
00:19:56.667 --> 00:20:01.500
I am a Jedi who studied here
under Master Reno Tsutara.

344
00:20:01.583 --> 00:20:06.708
We have witnessed Nawaam's cruelty.
as he sets out to conquer our galaxy.

345
00:20:06.792 --> 00:20:09.458
He has joined forces
with the remaining Sith

346
00:20:09.542 --> 00:20:13.167
and grows his ranks
by recruiting those who only seek power.

347
00:20:13.917 --> 00:20:17.667
There is no faction in the galaxy
capable of resisting Nawaam.

348
00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:21.917
I believe he can still be stopped!

349
00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:23.833
But only if we stand together.

350
00:20:23.917 --> 00:20:26.417
Otherwise. the galaxy
will enter a dark age.

351
00:20:27.750 --> 00:20:30.083
Our future now depends on all of you.

352
00:20:31.292 --> 00:20:32.708
[silence]

353
00:20:36.125 --> 00:20:37.792
[sighs]

354
00:20:39.125 --> 00:20:40.125
Huh?

355
00:20:40.208 --> 00:20:42.292
-[Kwana grunts]
-[Homen gasps]

356
00:20:42.375 --> 00:20:44.042
-[screams]
-[grunts]

357
00:20:44.125 --> 00:20:45.500
[grunting]

358
00:20:45.583 --> 00:20:47.542
-I'm ashamed to even know you cowards!
-[Kara grunts]

359
00:20:47.625 --> 00:20:48.667
-[Kwana grunts]
-[Homen] Ah!

360
00:20:48.750 --> 00:20:50.458
What happened to your backbone?

361
00:20:50.542 --> 00:20:52.833
Since when did you all become
so faint of heart?

362
00:20:52.917 --> 00:20:53.917
[straining. gasps]

363
00:20:54.042 --> 00:20:56.250
[Kwana] The galaxy
needs the strength of us miners!

364
00:20:56.333 --> 00:20:58.042
It needs us now more than ever!

365
00:20:58.708 --> 00:21:00.333
Then tell us this. Kwana.

366
00:21:00.417 --> 00:21:01.792
Why should we get involved?

367
00:21:01.875 --> 00:21:05.208
What does that galaxy's war
have to do with us Asteroid Diggers?

368
00:21:05.292 --> 00:21:08.792
You're right.
If you spend your life inside this rock.

369
00:21:08.875 --> 00:21:12.333
then you don't have to worry
about the rest of the galaxy.

370
00:21:12.417 --> 00:21:13.417
Fine!

371
00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:16.958
But then it will only be a matter of time
before Nawaam comes for us.

372
00:21:17.042 --> 00:21:19.458
So what? That doesn't change the fact

373
00:21:19.542 --> 00:21:22.417
that we don't stand a chance
against Nawaam. He's too powerful.

374
00:21:22.500 --> 00:21:25.708
This man right here
is brave enough to do it!

375
00:21:25.792 --> 00:21:28.125
And he's traveled far to do so!

376
00:21:28.208 --> 00:21:30.875
And I could not be prouder
to call him brother!

377
00:21:30.958 --> 00:21:32.250
[grunting]

378
00:21:32.333 --> 00:21:34.583
-[Kwana] And I will follow him!
-[gasps]

379
00:21:36.125 --> 00:21:39.542
Because... helping each other
is what brothers do.

380
00:21:39.625 --> 00:21:41.750
[♪ somber music playing]

381
00:21:41.833 --> 00:21:42.833
[Homen] Kara. wait.

382
00:21:42.917 --> 00:21:44.500
-[Kara grunts. gasps]
-[wood snaps]

383
00:21:44.583 --> 00:21:46.083
-[Kwana whimpers]
-[all gasp]

384
00:21:46.167 --> 00:21:47.708
[Kwana grunts]

385
00:21:47.792 --> 00:21:50.458
Listen! I used to think
the same way as you do.

386
00:21:50.542 --> 00:21:52.750
That war only happened in faraway places.

387
00:21:52.833 --> 00:21:56.208
But then. suddenly. one day.
Nawaam took my father away.

388
00:21:56.292 --> 00:21:58.458
[miners gasping]

389
00:21:58.542 --> 00:21:59.667
-Brave miners!
-[Homen grunts]

390
00:21:59.750 --> 00:22:03.083
With your help.
we will be strong enough to defeat Nawaam!

391
00:22:03.167 --> 00:22:05.917
-[Homen grunts]
-Please help us!

392
00:22:08.208 --> 00:22:10.208
[breath trembling]

393
00:22:14.625 --> 00:22:16.292
[miner 1] I will help you!

394
00:22:16.375 --> 00:22:18.250
-[miner 2] Hmm?
-[miner 3 gasps]

395
00:22:18.333 --> 00:22:20.208
[gasps]

396
00:22:20.750 --> 00:22:22.000
I will too!

397
00:22:22.083 --> 00:22:23.083
As will I!

398
00:22:23.167 --> 00:22:24.167
We're with you!

399
00:22:24.250 --> 00:22:25.875
[miner 4] Leave it to us!

400
00:22:25.958 --> 00:22:28.833
-[miners assenting]
-[chuckles softly]

401
00:22:33.792 --> 00:22:35.958
-[Kara grunts]
-[miners cheering]

402
00:22:36.042 --> 00:22:37.167
[Kara] Kwana!

403
00:22:38.167 --> 00:22:40.708
I'm not the type to sit around worrying.

404
00:22:40.792 --> 00:22:42.958
I'll just go straight to the source.

405
00:22:43.042 --> 00:22:44.375
And when we find Zhima.

406
00:22:44.458 --> 00:22:47.708
I'll be able to get answers about
what happened straight from his mouth.

407
00:22:48.542 --> 00:22:49.542
[Juro] Kwana.

408
00:22:51.042 --> 00:22:52.750
-[metal clinks]
-Here. take this.

409
00:22:53.542 --> 00:22:54.667
[gasps]

410
00:22:57.542 --> 00:22:59.417
I don't understand. What is this?

411
00:23:01.292 --> 00:23:03.625
It is a lightsaber forged by Zhima.

412
00:23:03.708 --> 00:23:07.125
I don't want it... or your pity.

413
00:23:07.208 --> 00:23:10.292
You already know
that I'm not strong in the Force.

414
00:23:10.375 --> 00:23:13.375
I don't have what it takes to be a Jedi.

415
00:23:13.458 --> 00:23:16.083
Having a strong connection to the Force

416
00:23:16.167 --> 00:23:18.833
was something that my former master
sought out.

417
00:23:19.583 --> 00:23:22.667
But what I am looking for
is something different.

418
00:23:22.750 --> 00:23:24.292
What I am looking for...

419
00:23:25.375 --> 00:23:29.250
are individuals who are willing to fight
on behalf of others.

420
00:23:29.333 --> 00:23:30.708
[gasps]

421
00:23:31.917 --> 00:23:34.917
There's no way you'd fight
as well as you do

422
00:23:35.000 --> 00:23:38.167
if you had truly given up on your dream
of being a Jedi.

423
00:23:39.292 --> 00:23:41.292
You might not believe in yourself.

424
00:23:41.375 --> 00:23:44.875
but I believe in you enough
to give you this lightsaber.

425
00:23:45.750 --> 00:23:46.750
[grunts]

426
00:23:48.417 --> 00:23:50.417
[♪ somber music continues]

427
00:23:54.958 --> 00:23:57.417
[grunting]

428
00:23:58.500 --> 00:24:00.000
-[exclaims]
-[lightsaber buzzing]

429
00:24:00.083 --> 00:24:01.583
[grunting]

430
00:24:01.667 --> 00:24:03.000
[gasps]

431
00:24:03.750 --> 00:24:05.583
[grunting]

432
00:24:05.667 --> 00:24:08.667
-[lightsaber buzzing]
-[breathing heavily]

433
00:24:10.333 --> 00:24:11.333
[sighs]

434
00:24:13.333 --> 00:24:14.667
[grunts]

435
00:24:17.208 --> 00:24:18.250
Hmm.

436
00:24:20.792 --> 00:24:24.250
So this is the kind of Jedi
that Juro was searching for.

437
00:24:24.333 --> 00:24:26.417
Seems like I'd be no match for him.

438
00:24:27.083 --> 00:24:29.292
[chuckles] I guess not.

439
00:24:29.375 --> 00:24:31.292
-[alarm blaring]
-[miner] Wh-- What?

440
00:24:31.375 --> 00:24:33.458
-[Kara and Homen gasp]
-[alarm stops]

441
00:24:33.542 --> 00:24:34.667
[powers up]

442
00:24:34.750 --> 00:24:36.625
[indistinct chatter]

443
00:24:40.958 --> 00:24:44.083
[Nawaam] <i>Hear me. denizens of the galaxy.</i>

444
00:24:44.167 --> 00:24:46.042
<i>My name is Nawaam.</i>

445
00:24:46.125 --> 00:24:49.042
<i>and I will bring order</i>
<i>to the chaos that surrounds us.</i>

446
00:24:50.250 --> 00:24:55.458
<i>Right now. across every sector.</i>
<i>mighty figures are vying for power.</i>

447
00:24:55.542 --> 00:24:56.583
[droid chirps]

448
00:24:56.667 --> 00:24:59.667
[Nawaam] <i>But how many among them</i>
<i>truly care about the galaxy?</i>

449
00:25:00.500 --> 00:25:04.417
<i>How many among them aim to bring about</i>
<i>the galaxy's unification?</i>

450
00:25:04.500 --> 00:25:05.875
[grunts]

451
00:25:06.958 --> 00:25:09.125
[Nawaam] This is a call for surrender.

452
00:25:10.167 --> 00:25:13.917
Yield now. and you will be allowed
to follow my army.

453
00:25:14.000 --> 00:25:15.292
[Four-Nines speaking Droid]

454
00:25:16.292 --> 00:25:18.458
[Nawaam in English] All those
who oppose us will be crushed.

455
00:25:20.125 --> 00:25:23.583
Our forces are ready and positioned
to take any of you on.

456
00:25:26.000 --> 00:25:28.125
There is no corner of the galaxy

457
00:25:28.208 --> 00:25:31.625
<i>that my kyber crystal cannon cannot reach.</i>

458
00:25:31.708 --> 00:25:34.625
<i>You will now witness its power.</i>

459
00:25:34.708 --> 00:25:37.292
<i>First. I will show you the destruction</i>

460
00:25:37.375 --> 00:25:41.917
<i>of those who offered a hiding place</i>
<i>to the corrupt Jedi rats.</i>

461
00:25:43.500 --> 00:25:45.500
[♪ sinister music playing]

462
00:25:45.583 --> 00:25:46.958
[gasps]

463
00:25:49.583 --> 00:25:51.958
[kyber crystals ringing]

464
00:25:54.542 --> 00:25:56.542
[ringing intensifies]

465
00:25:59.250 --> 00:26:01.750
[♪ sinister music swells]

466
00:26:03.708 --> 00:26:04.708
[Nawaam] Fire.

467
00:26:05.417 --> 00:26:07.167
[weapon powering up]

468
00:26:09.750 --> 00:26:12.667
-[electricity crackling]
-[explosions]

469
00:26:12.750 --> 00:26:14.417
[laser booming]

470
00:26:16.250 --> 00:26:17.542
[whooshes]

471
00:26:18.875 --> 00:26:20.417
[thuds]

472
00:26:20.500 --> 00:26:22.042
[whooshes]

473
00:26:23.208 --> 00:26:25.542
[silence]

474
00:26:25.625 --> 00:26:27.583
-[laser booming]
-[gasps]

475
00:26:31.875 --> 00:26:33.500
[rumbling]

476
00:26:33.583 --> 00:26:36.708
-[people screaming]
-[gasps]

477
00:26:39.000 --> 00:26:41.208
-[rumbling]
-[all gasping]

478
00:26:45.250 --> 00:26:47.250
[♪ sinister music playing]

479
00:26:55.042 --> 00:26:57.042
[♪ theme music playing]

480
00:27:45.167 --> 00:27:46.333
[♪ music ends]
